      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file presigned_download.py, I need to write code that uses a concrete external provider to generate a time-limited signed download URL for a stored object. The code must be identifiable by the provider. I will use Amazon S3 as the external provider, as it is a widely used managed object storage service. The boto3 library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, will be used to interact with Amazon S3. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
